1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
The Diamond Kingdom launched an attack on the Clover border village of Khitan to pave the way for a full-blown invasion.

5
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:47,000
But the Golden Dawn, led by Captain Vongins, was quick to reinforce the village's defenses, and the tide of battle seemed to be turning in favor of the Clover Kingdom.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Wind magic. Swift white bow!

7
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:02,000
I thought I saw a familiar speck down here. So what brings you to Khitan, Asta?

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,000
If you got those injuries while fighting someone like I think you did, then that must mean you got stronger again.

9
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,000
I won't lose. Got that?

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Not just me! Looks like you've gotten more powerful too!

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
But I won't lose either. No way!

12
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
I won't lose.

13
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
I won't lose.

14
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Go away!

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Magoo Playstation

16
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:32,000
So how dare you ask?

17
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,000
I won't lose.

18
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Please tell me the confidence in the showroom's scenario.

19
00:01:37,000 --> 00:02:06,980
Thank you.

20
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:36,980
Thank you.

21
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Thank you.

22
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Thank you.

23
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,240
He's actually smiling!

24
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:17,820
Am I going crazy or have you gotten taller since the last time I saw you?

25
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:23,180
You know barely says a word to me, but this guy gets a whole conversation?

26
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:26,300
Oh yeah. By a couple of inches, I think.

27
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:29,240
It should be my turn for a growth spurt! No fair!

28
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:34,880
Well, you won't beat me! I'll at eight by tomorrow, and then I'll be the one looking down on you!

29
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,620
No! Not happening.

30
00:03:37,620 --> 00:03:39,940
You think you're so great just because you're tall?

31
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:41,680
What do you think you're doing, Yuno?

32
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:45,780
Who is this guy and why are you talking to him so much?

33
00:03:45,780 --> 00:03:55,460
He's the thing! Quit ignoring me!

34
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:58,760
What's with the squeaky crying bug pulling on your face?

35
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:01,480
Wait! Is that Sylph?

36
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:06,720
I've never seen Yuno make that face before! She must be really powerful!

37
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:10,420
You tell me who this banged-up spiky-haired pimp squeak is right now!

38
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,680
I'm a pimp squeak?

39
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:14,620
He and I lived together when we were younger.

40
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:21,640
Wait! You what? Seriously? You loved what this banged?

41
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:28,120
That's right. We ate together and studied together, too. Not to mention sleeping and taking baths together.

42
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:37,120
Sleeping together? And bathing?

43
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:48,300
I know it's been a while, but I wanted to thank you for boldly risking your life to save my lunch the last time we saw each other.

44
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,760
You're like a prince of a fairy tale.

45
00:04:56,960 --> 00:05:00,320
Yeah, that's right. I remember you now.

46
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:03,580
Here! A hearty after-battle snack just for you!

47
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:04,200
Thanks.

48
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:08,060
Oh, and a little something extra to make it even yummier.

49
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:09,460
Okay.

50
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,800
What's her story? She's obviously got it bad for Yuno.

51
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:19,820
My name's Charmy, by the way. Would it be alright if I called you Yuno?

52
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,920
Yeah, that's fine.

53
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:21,580
Great!

54
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:23,220
Nice taster.

55
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,120
I'm glad.

56
00:05:25,340 --> 00:05:28,380
My Sylph's intuition tells me this little girl's no threat.

57
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:32,700
Sorry about last time. I didn't mean to wind up on top of you.

58
00:05:32,700 --> 00:05:40,180
Oh, don't worry your pretty head about that. I know I didn't lose any sleep over it.

59
00:05:41,180 --> 00:05:43,520
On top of her! No!

60
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,200
What?

61
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:50,420
Hey! Are you trying to cast some kind of spell on Yuno to make him like you?

62
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:52,040
Don't you dare, you little brat!

63
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:57,100
Huh? What kind of creature is that? I wonder if it tastes good.

64
00:05:57,500 --> 00:06:00,760
She's a wind spirit, Charmy, and we don't eat spirits, okay?

65
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:04,120
You two need to back up before I get really mad!

66
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:06,140
Yuno is mine and nobody else is!

67
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:08,500
You'd better be careful who you're calling a little brat.

68
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:09,960
I'll have you know I'm 19.

69
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:13,300
A worldly woman who can teach sweet Yuno a thing or two.

70
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:16,820
And my sexiness doesn't need any magical enhancements either.

71
00:06:16,940 --> 00:06:20,160
Sexiness? You've got to be kidding me, you fun-sized five head!

72
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,140
Oh yeah?

73
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:26,160
Maybe you should take a look in the mirror sometime, Shrippy!

74
00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:27,420
How dare you!

75
00:06:27,580 --> 00:06:30,020
I'll show you what happens when you toss back to us still!

76
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,960
Yeah! Let's see it!

77
00:06:41,140 --> 00:06:42,020
That's it!

78
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:44,300
I'll try you up and hit you for dinner!

79
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:48,840
You're gone now!

80
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:52,000
Charmy, please just let it go!

81
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:54,480
Well, I think that's enough.

82
00:06:57,960 --> 00:06:59,820
Looks like you guys are having fun.

83
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:01,180
Can I join the party?

84
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,560
Hey, where have you been?

85
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:04,400
Who's he?

86
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:07,160
That's Finral. He's one of the senior Black Bulls.

87
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,720
You might have heard of him before.

88
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:09,540
Not at all.

89
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,500
Not surprising.

90
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:13,480
He's one of the elite Golden Dawn after-

91
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:13,840
Oh my!

92
00:07:14,140 --> 00:07:15,320
What have we here?

93
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,580
If it isn't my big brother.

94
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,720
It's been simply ages.

95
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:22,280
And of all places to run into you again.

96
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:24,140
Of course you'd be here.

97
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:25,300
Who's that?

98
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:29,100
Your pitiful fighting skills are a disgrace to our whole family.

99
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,260
What business do you have in battle?

100
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:34,900
Hey, Finral, who's this jerk and why's he saying all that rude stuff to you?

101
00:07:34,900 --> 00:07:36,440
My little brother.

102
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:41,760
This is Longris Vod, Vice Captain of the Golden Dawn.

103
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:44,880
Seriously?

104
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:50,220
And I assume you're still performing your duties as the Black Bulls' pack mule.

105
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:56,540
If you weren't so hopelessly incompetent, it would be you carrying on the Vod family legacy instead of me.

106
00:07:57,500 --> 00:07:58,440
You're wrong!

107
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:00,620
Finral's an awesome fighter!

108
00:08:01,100 --> 00:08:02,340
Like in our last battle!

109
00:08:02,820 --> 00:08:05,960
We wouldn't have been able to take the enemy down if it weren't for him!

110
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:09,900
You mean he actually managed to make himself useful for once?

111
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,380
Now there's a shock.

112
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,960
Hey, that's your big brother you're talking about!

113
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,620
Don't you think you ought to show some respect?

114
00:08:16,620 --> 00:08:18,240
Why would I show him respect?

115
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,320
It's not like he's earned it.

116
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:21,920
Listen, jerk!

117
00:08:23,700 --> 00:08:25,260
It's okay, Asta, really.

118
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:27,020
I mean, it's all true, right?

119
00:08:28,540 --> 00:08:29,660
No, it's not.

120
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:30,660
Just drop it.

121
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:34,080
The Diamond Kingdom's troops have been more or less wiped out.

122
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:34,920
They're finished.

123
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:37,720
Thanks to our captain and his world tree magic.

124
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:41,920
So your sad little squad can run along home now.

125
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:47,060
But tell me, when did the Black Bulls start running a daycare service?

126
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:51,420
Have you been downgraded from packed mule to babysitter?

127
00:08:51,860 --> 00:08:55,960
Looking after these snot-nosed brats, you must be simply mortified.

128
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:58,380
Who are you calling a snot-nosed brat?

129
00:08:58,620 --> 00:09:01,120
Only a girl who wants to have this kind of shark!

130
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:03,080
That's enough.

131
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:05,620
You can mock me all you want to, Longris.

132
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,820
I don't care.

133
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,360
But them?

134
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:12,100
Don't you dare mock my squadmates!

135
00:09:12,180 --> 00:09:12,660
Not ever!

136
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:13,520
Wow.

137
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:16,080
So there's some fight in you after all.

138
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:31,380
I'm done playing.

139
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:34,820
I swear on the honor of the eight shining generous.

140
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:36,900
I will have your hands!

141
00:09:36,900 --> 00:09:39,320
From here I thought we'd dealt with all of you people.

142
00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:43,980
If I attack, my spatial magic will wind up hitting the villagers that are trapped in there too.

143
00:09:46,900 --> 00:09:47,800
That's right!

144
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:49,780
So what are you going to do now?

145
00:09:49,780 --> 00:09:50,280
Help us!

146
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:50,880
Please!

147
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:51,660
No!

148
00:09:52,140 --> 00:09:53,400
We're all going to die!

149
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:59,920
No time to hesitate.

150
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:01,260
Well, too bad.

151
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:04,500
I suppose they'll have to make the ultimate sacrifice for their country.

152
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:05,600
Stop!

153
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:06,660
Huh?

154
00:10:06,660 --> 00:10:11,200
How could you just kill your own people like that?

155
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:13,380
It's our duty to protect them!

156
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:17,020
There are only going to be more casualties if I do nothing.

157
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,040
No way!

158
00:10:18,620 --> 00:10:20,240
I'm not giving up on anybody!

159
00:10:20,580 --> 00:10:22,300
Finral Charmy, let's go!

160
00:10:22,860 --> 00:10:23,280
Right!

161
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:23,700
Roger!

162
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,320
Watch this, you know.

163
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,640
All right.

164
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:31,800
Show me what you've got.

165
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:34,500
What could he hope to do in that state?

166
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:39,140
Retreat as quickly as possible.

167
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:41,000
Cotton creation magic!

168
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,360
Fluffy sheep cushion!

169
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:52,820
Who the hell do you think you are?

170
00:10:52,940 --> 00:10:54,400
Don't challenge me!

171
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,040
What?

172
00:11:00,300 --> 00:11:01,200
Spatial magic?

173
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:22,100
My new chrismatics been completely nullified.

174
00:11:22,300 --> 00:11:23,640
How is that even possible?

175
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:23,760
What?

176
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:27,720
What have you done, you brat?

177
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:57,700
Thanks for that, Yuno, I owe you!

178
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:01,720
No problem. Nice fighting as always, Asta.

179
00:12:02,900 --> 00:12:04,660
He's smiling again!

180
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:07,640
Longris!

181
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:17,220
It's true that I could never hope to best you, but someday the Black Bulls will best the Golden Dawn!

182
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:18,040
Yeah!

183
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:27,820
So, World Tree Magic, is that the only kind you got? Nothing else?

184
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:29,280
What are you implying?

185
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:34,100
Well, I'm the kind of guy who goes with his gut instinct.

186
00:12:34,100 --> 00:12:40,720
Vangence, if you don't mind, lose the mask.

187
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:55,420
Vangence, if you don't mind, lose the mask.

188
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:59,980
My face isn't exactly fit for others to see.

189
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:03,100
What, you wear that thing because you're super ugly or something?

190
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:06,640
Hey, it's okay. I promise not to laugh, alright?

191
00:13:07,340 --> 00:13:11,020
I understand, Yami. You are suspicious of me, aren't you?

192
00:13:11,020 --> 00:13:14,620
You think I might be the leader of the Eye of the Midnight Sun?

193
00:13:16,540 --> 00:13:18,220
Frankly, I do, yeah.

194
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:22,120
His light magic, Vangence's World Tree Magic.

195
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:25,440
They're different, sure, but something isn't right.

196
00:13:26,580 --> 00:13:28,740
They've got the same build, similar voices.

197
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:31,400
Most of all, their key feels the same.

198
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:32,500
Still.

199
00:13:32,940 --> 00:13:35,340
It's been ten years since we met, hasn't it?

200
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:36,740
That's correct.

201
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:39,220
So we've had a pretty long history, you and me.

202
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:42,760
Meeting on the battlefield, fighting alongside each other from time to time,

203
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,940
even eventually becoming captains together.

204
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:47,680
Remember how bouncy Nozel's braid used to be?

205
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:52,260
I'm not saying we're especially friendly, but we do go back a while.

206
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:56,280
There's something about him that I feel in you, too.

207
00:13:56,940 --> 00:13:57,780
So come on.

208
00:13:58,460 --> 00:13:59,840
Show me your face.

209
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:02,700
Show me your face.

210
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:03,000
Very well.

211
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,160
Those are some pretty nasty scars.

212
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:24,040
Had them long?

213
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,040
Always.

214
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:26,500
My whole life.

215
00:14:27,140 --> 00:14:28,780
They called me a cursed child.

216
00:14:28,940 --> 00:14:29,680
Is that right?

217
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,420
Not even magic can heal these marks.

218
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:36,680
People found them eerie to look at, and they feared me.

219
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:39,560
I was a nobleman's illegitimate child.

220
00:14:40,220 --> 00:14:42,980
Until I was eight years old, I lived in the Forsaken Realm.

221
00:14:44,020 --> 00:14:46,360
But then the nobleman's heir passed away.

222
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:50,200
He summoned me, brought me into his house to be his successor.

223
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:55,220
Fortunately, I possessed great power, and my magic was a curiosity.

224
00:14:55,220 --> 00:15:03,100
But even there, my face was despised, and the nobleman's wife, my foster mother, treated me cruelly.

225
00:15:03,100 --> 00:15:06,820
I wouldn't wish the sort of childhood I had on anyone.

226
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:10,080
But I don't want to see and truette her at a time.

227
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,300
It seems like you've been through a lot.

228
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:14,980
Yes, but that's also when I met Julius.

229
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:20,180
He paid no mind to my appearance, instead seeing only my strength.

230
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:31,680
Incredible! What was that magic you were just using?

231
00:15:32,260 --> 00:15:33,720
Um, World Tree magic.

232
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:37,940
Now there's a marvelous name, and well-suited for such marvelous magic.

233
00:15:38,100 --> 00:15:39,600
I've never seen anything like it.

234
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,600
Um...

235
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:45,940
Truly, it's such a lovely spell.

236
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:48,080
Like you want to safeguard everything.

237
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:49,660
Wrap it in kindness.

238
00:15:51,700 --> 00:15:55,140
Now then, you absolutely must become a magic knight!

239
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:57,600
I...

240
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,840
No?

241
00:15:59,260 --> 00:16:02,540
It's not that I don't want to, but the magic knights?

242
00:16:02,680 --> 00:16:04,380
I never thought I could join them.

243
00:16:05,380 --> 00:16:07,820
I mean, with this face.

244
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:10,880
Now, now, that isn't anything to worry about.

245
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:12,360
What?

246
00:16:12,900 --> 00:16:13,860
I'm serious.

247
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:16,460
Your face isn't something you ought to be ashamed of.

248
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:18,820
However, if it bothers you that much...

249
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:20,820
Well, in that case...

250
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:23,540
I'll give you this mask!

251
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:31,880
But, Julia, sir, this is so...

252
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:32,720
Tacky.

253
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:35,720
But I worked on it so hard!

254
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,840
I was happy.

255
00:16:38,500 --> 00:16:41,300
And I vowed to devote my Grimoire to his service.

256
00:16:41,300 --> 00:16:44,360
Well, that's a familiar story.

257
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:48,060
His face and bearing both resemble the Light Mages.

258
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:51,380
But I'm not picking up any trace of power in those scars.

259
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:54,440
No tricks at work here.

260
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:56,640
He's not showing me an illusion.

261
00:16:56,980 --> 00:17:00,300
And more than that, his key tells me he's not lying.

262
00:17:01,060 --> 00:17:03,420
So, I guess the resemblance is purely coincidence.

263
00:17:03,420 --> 00:17:06,000
Right, well, sorry.

264
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:06,940
No.

265
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:10,120
I'm glad I got the chance to show you who I am.

266
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:11,720
Thank you, Yami.

267
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:13,360
Sure thing.

268
00:17:14,600 --> 00:17:15,980
Captain Vongens, do you read me?

269
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,100
The Diamond Kingdom has begun to retreat.

270
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:19,280
Very good.

271
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,660
Don't pursue those who flee.

272
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:23,540
Concentrate all your efforts on healing the injured.

273
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:24,520
Understood.

274
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:26,800
We should get to work.

275
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:29,000
With the number of prisoners we've captured,

276
00:17:29,180 --> 00:17:30,600
