342
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:10,400
There's no rule saying that a commoner can't be the Wizard King.

343
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:11,140
Huh?

344
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:14,780
First, of course, I'll become captain of the Golden Dawn.

345
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:17,020
Will you?

346
00:20:17,560 --> 00:20:20,560
