347
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:23,180
Yuno!

348
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:24,320
Good.

349
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:26,920
The area's clear and we've treated the majority of the ingi-

350
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:29,300
What did I miss?

351
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:32,380
The Diamond troops have withdrawn,

352
00:20:32,700 --> 00:20:34,200
