357
00:20:42,220 --> 00:20:42,660
Yes, sir.

358
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:45,460
Now then, what is this really about?

359
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:49,280
Their attempted invasion didn't strike me as a very serious one.

360
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,220
What are they truly after?

361
00:20:51,220 --> 00:21:01,920
Fascinating.

362
00:21:02,140 --> 00:21:02,800
A sylph.

363
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:04,820
Offensive spatial spells.

364
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:06,900
Parasitic world tree magic.

365
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:09,840
It sounds as if they had much to contend with.

366
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:13,400
Those crumbling old generals may have been powerful once,

367
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:14,920
but their day has passed.

368
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:18,360
Now the time has come for we mage knights

369
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:20,920
